#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:5 5e155b913d0346c69bd7958c44fd8f08
msgid "ROS 2 with Gazebo"
msgstr "ROS 2 与 Gazebo"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:7 9587b9bc16c34aeebdf0ef7d7ee0143d
msgid ""
"The purpose of this guide is to show how to integrate ArduPilot with Gazebo "
"using ROS 2."
msgstr "本指南旨在介绍如何通过 ROS 2 将 ArduPilot 与 Gazebo 集成。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:10 22f4b9714de64af48d451c03dc60d30b
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:12 db4805d730574b56aebaa1a5b4f5b012
msgid ""
"Ensure you have the prerequisites complete and working before beginning this"
" Gazebo tutorial."
msgstr "在开始本 Gazebo 教程之前，请确保已完成并验证所有前提条件。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:14 ceaa2ef6029945428156174100d793e9
msgid ":ref:`Install ROS 2 <ros2>`"
msgstr ":ref:`安装 ROS 2 <ros2>`"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:15 f99ce96bfb6e49ecb152836b40a37b09
msgid ":ref:`Install and Run ROS 2 with ArduPilot SITL <ros2-sitl>`"
msgstr ":ref:`安装并运行 ROS 2 与 ArduPilot SITL <ros2-sitl>`"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:18 6d7fe0dcc19944f9af50a50f476c07ea
msgid ""
"Ensure OpenGL hardware acceleration is enabled on your system before "
"proceeding. Using software rendering will result in very poor performance "
"from Gazebo."
msgstr "在继续之前，请确保系统已启用 OpenGL 硬件加速。使用软件渲染将导致 Gazebo 性能非常低下。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:23 d91e35bb958f4de184a8e35494112dd6
msgid "Install Gazebo"
msgstr "安装 Gazebo"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:25 9b3b81b97bde48c290a5d5ba5ab7adc9
msgid ""
"First, install `Gazebo Harmonic (recommended) "
"<https://gazebosim.org/docs/harmonic/install>`__ or `Gazebo Garden "
"<https://gazebosim.org/docs/garden/install>`__."
msgstr ""
"首先，安装 `Gazebo Harmonic（推荐） <https://gazebosim.org/docs/harmonic/install>`__ "
"或 `Gazebo Garden <https://gazebosim.org/docs/garden/install>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:27 d93579dde2c24d9ba4969cc638221282
msgid "Next, set up all the necessary ROS 2 packages in the workspace."
msgstr "接下来，在工作空间中配置所有必要的 ROS 2 软件包。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:29 47e50e12cbbe460c8a47dab24ee4417b
msgid ""
"We will clone the required repositories using `vcstool "
"<https://github.com/dirk-thomas/vcstool>`__ and a `ros2.repos` files:"
msgstr ""
"我们将使用 `vcstool <https://github.com/dirk-thomas/vcstool>`__ 和 `ros2.repos` "
"文件克隆所需的代码仓库："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:36 7543460e6ab542a286137f94705c10df
msgid ""
"Set the Gazebo version to either ``harmonic`` (recommended) or ``garden``. "
"It's recommended to set this in your `~/.bashrc` file."
msgstr ""
"将 Gazebo 版本设置为 ``harmonic`` （推荐）或 ``garden``。建议将此设置添加到 `~/.bashrc` 文件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:43 fcd52692f2ce4d89b87d2cbee471720c
msgid "Add Gazebo APT sources."
msgstr "添加 Gazebo APT 软件源。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:52 057c2f49206d464db06251f9d5dd97a5
msgid ""
"Add Gazebo sources to `rosdep` for the non-default pairing of ROS 2 Humble "
"and Gazebo Harmonic."
msgstr "针对 ROS 2 Humble 与 Gazebo Harmonic 的非默认组合，将 Gazebo 源添加到 `rosdep`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:59 8d87c302bafa45e79af5e3d494a4f9b2
msgid "Update ROS and Gazebo dependencies:"
msgstr "更新 ROS 和 Gazebo 依赖项："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:70 581913b20ca842b18bcd4fb05485522b
msgid "Build and Run Tests"
msgstr "构建并运行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:72 8b3451d60251400c9085423dd81a261f
msgid "Build:"
msgstr "构建："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:79 496ed92d8bb444328162be3a6e5cec91
msgid "If you'd like to test your installation, run:"
msgstr "如果您想测试安装是否成功，请运行："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:89 9c0db01f8d354d138a37bc1ae9384546
msgid "Run the Simulation"
msgstr "运行仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:91 a2227b20039b4dd9bac5c95eb371c05c
msgid ""
"Finally, you can source the workspace and launch one of the example Gazebo "
"simulations:"
msgstr "最后，激活工作空间并启动其中一个 Gazebo 示例仿真："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:98 b3deb36d7cdf4548b48ee1e1e31fec25
msgid ""
"By default, this launch file starts ArduPilot SITL, Gazebo, and RViz with a "
"single command."
msgstr "默认情况下，此启动文件通过单条命令启动 ArduPilot SITL、Gazebo 和 RViz。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-gazebo.rst:103 aae8a25975504574b6c720df078bf355
msgid ""
"For more information regarding the `ardupilot_gz` package refer to "
"`ardupilot_gz/README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gz#ardupilot_gz>`__."
msgstr ""
"关于 `ardupilot_gz` 软件包的更多信息，请参阅 `ardupilot_gz/README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gz#ardupilot_gz>`__。"

